[Script Info]Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.709PlayResX: 1920PlayResY: 1080[V4+ Styles]Format: Name, Fontname, Fontsize, PrimaryColour, SecondaryColour, OutlineColour, BackColour, Bold, Italic, Underline, StrikeOut, ScaleX, ScaleY, Spacing, Angle, BorderStyle, Outline, Shadow, Alignment, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, EncodingStyle: Main-207+,Impress BT,83,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.75,3.75,2,180,180,27,1Style: Title,Agency FB,95,&H00FEFEFE,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,120,100,0.75,0,1,2.7,0,2,15,15,360,1Style: Captions-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,56,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,15,15,30,1Style: Credits-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,60,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,1.5,0,1,3.8,0,7,15,15,15,1Style: Lyrics-OP5,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,57,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00060606,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,1,0,1,4,0,2,33,33,27,1Style: Karaoke-OP5,Duality,90,&H000090FF,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,8,15,15,15,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 5,0:02:04.10,0:02:09.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! I heard that a storm surge  called Aqua Laguna is approaching!Dialogue: 5,0:02:09.44,0:02:13.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep! This town  will be submerged by midnight!Dialogue: 5,0:02:13.49,0:02:15.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This shore will be totally submerged too!Dialogue: 5,0:02:15.49,0:02:18.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's terrible! We can't stay here!Dialogue: 5,0:02:18.24,0:02:20.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right! We shouldn't stay here!Dialogue: 5,0:02:20.79,0:02:22.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'd better hurry up and evacuate to high ground!Dialogue: 5,0:02:22.87,0:02:24.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right! Let's hurry up and evacuate!Dialogue: 5,0:02:24.62,0:02:27.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Evacuate! Evacuate! – Evacuate! Evacuate!Dialogue: 5,0:02:30.13,0:02:31.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evacuate! Evacuate!Dialogue: 5,0:02:42.73,0:02:44.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 5,0:02:48.52,0:02:51.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What were those voices just now?Dialogue: 5,0:02:53.36,0:02:54.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make sure you evacuate!Dialogue: 5,0:02:54.99,0:02:57.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evacuate, Usopp!Dialogue: 5,0:02:57.82,0:03:00.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They were saying something  about a storm surge.Dialogue: 5,0:03:00.85,0:03:05.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it...  the wind is awfully strong.Dialogue: 5,0:03:07.29,0:03:09.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!  I said let go of me!Dialogue: 5,0:03:09.87,0:03:12.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What did we do?!Dialogue: 5,0:03:12.00,0:03:14.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't act all innocent, you damn assassins!Dialogue: 5,0:03:14.51,0:03:17.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you shoot Iceburg-san ?!  We won't let you get away!Dialogue: 5,0:03:18.39,0:03:22.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop it, you guys!  We're saying we didn't do anything!Dialogue: 5,0:03:22.14,0:03:23.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 5,0:03:23.77,0:03:27.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First off, Robin doesn't even have a reason to go after Iceburg-san !Dialogue: 5,0:03:28.69,0:03:31.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep telling yourself that.Dialogue: 5,0:03:31.77,0:03:35.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In any case, this is it for you two.Dialogue: 5,0:03:35.74,0:03:38.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By harming Iceburg-san,Dialogue: 5,0:03:38.49,0:03:42.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you're making an enemy of both us,  Galley-La Company,Dialogue: 5,0:03:43.29,0:03:49.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the whole city of Water Seven.Dialogue: 5,0:03:49.38,0:03:52.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you saying crazy stuff like that?!Dialogue: 5,0:03:52.21,0:03:54.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me talk to Iceboss!Dialogue: 5,0:03:54.13,0:03:56.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just give up, pirate!Dialogue: 5,0:03:57.55,0:04:00.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beat him up, Galley-La Company!Dialogue: 5,0:04:21.82,0:04:23.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Straw Hat?!Dialogue: 5,0:04:23.66,0:04:26.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just gonna defend, or will you actually fight?!Dialogue: 5,0:04:26.83,0:04:30.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I said, I don't have any reason to fight you!Dialogue: 5,0:04:33.59,0:04:37.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now we know that pistols don't work on you.Dialogue: 5,0:04:40.09,0:04:42.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit. Looks like they're all serious about this.Dialogue: 5,0:04:49.31,0:04:50.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was a direct hit!Dialogue: 5,0:04:52.31,0:04:54.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, he got away.Dialogue: 5,0:04:57.74,0:04:59.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was close.Dialogue: 5,0:05:27.06,0:05:29.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shoot! Can't move!Dialogue: 5,0:05:35.31,0:05:36.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:05:36.42,0:05:37.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! They got him!Dialogue: 5,0:05:49.29,0:05:55.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yay! Just as you'd expect from our pride and joy,  Galley-La Company! Yay!Dialogue: 5,0:05:55.08,0:05:57.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was fantastic!Dialogue: 5,0:05:57.13,0:06:00.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right. A guy like that deserves to get blown up!Dialogue: 5,0:06:05.60,0:06:07.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well...Dialogue: 5,0:06:07.93,0:06:13.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, you know, that Short Hat is  the Franky Family's detestable enemy.Dialogue: 5,0:06:14.65,0:06:19.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was the one who was fighting him first.Dialogue: 5,0:06:19.73,0:06:26.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you come along  and snatch my prey away from me?Dialogue: 5,0:06:27.07,0:06:30.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just how many times do I have to repeat myself, you bastards?!Dialogue: 5,0:06:30.54,0:06:33.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Galley-Laaa!!Dialogue: 5,0:06:33.66,0:06:39.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just hold your horses. We'll deal with you after we catch hold of this one.Dialogue: 5,0:06:39.00,0:06:44.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I said, why in the hell  are you capturing my prey?!Dialogue: 5,0:06:44.88,0:06:49.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, never mind. Seems like you guys don't get what I'm saying.Dialogue: 5,0:06:49.60,0:06:50.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paulie! Watch out!Dialogue: 5,0:06:50.72,0:06:52.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Galley-La! Run!Dialogue: 5,0:06:52.35,0:06:56.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky is gonna launch a crazy attack!Dialogue: 5,0:06:56.40,0:06:57.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:07:02.78,0:07:04.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Connector set.Dialogue: 5,0:07:07.37,0:07:10.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He brought down a huge crane earlier  with the same attack!Dialogue: 5,0:07:10.95,0:07:12.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brought down a crane?Dialogue: 5,0:07:13.16,0:07:14.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A cannon?Dialogue: 5,0:07:14.16,0:07:16.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run! Galley-La!Dialogue: 5,0:07:16.92,0:07:19.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rah! Rah! Take 'em out, Bro!Dialogue: 5,0:07:20.42,0:07:23.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not gonna shoot a cannonball.Dialogue: 5,0:07:23.97,0:07:26.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What I'll fire is an air bullet.Dialogue: 5,0:07:26.68,0:07:30.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it's faster than the speed of sound.Dialogue: 5,0:07:30.81,0:07:32.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Air?Dialogue: 5,0:07:33.98,0:07:36.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Danger! Run!Dialogue: 5,0:07:43.32,0:07:44.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell?Dialogue: 5,0:07:52.03,0:07:54.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Coup de Vent!Dialogue: 5,0:08:36.75,0:08:39.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow! What the hell was that?!Dialogue: 5,0:08:39.46,0:08:42.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It felt like high-pressure winds crashed into us!Dialogue: 5,0:08:42.71,0:08:45.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Another crane is coming down!Dialogue: 5,0:08:45.13,0:08:48.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run! It's falling this way!Dialogue: 5,0:08:51.39,0:08:53.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!Dialogue: 5,0:08:53.01,0:08:55.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's coming down!Dialogue: 5,0:08:57.81,0:08:59.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Get crushed!Dialogue: 5,0:09:00.77,0:09:06.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crush this whole damn shipyard!Dialogue: 5,0:09:21.54,0:09:26.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just who is this guy?! How'd he get cyborg technology?!Dialogue: 5,0:09:26.71,0:09:29.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what was that weird cannon?!Dialogue: 5,0:09:29.34,0:09:31.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah... but...Dialogue: 5,0:09:32.09,0:09:34.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it helped me get free!Dialogue: 5,0:09:34.35,0:09:35.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami! Run!Dialogue: 5,0:09:35.85,0:09:36.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 5,0:09:36.64,0:09:38.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?Dialogue: 5,0:09:40.60,0:09:43.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something like that couldn't bring me down!Dialogue: 5,0:09:44.61,0:09:47.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I don't get it.Dialogue: 5,0:09:47.78,0:09:49.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have to see Iceboss somehow!Dialogue: 5,0:09:49.74,0:09:54.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! We're going?!  It's impossible in this commotion!Dialogue: 5,0:09:54.82,0:09:57.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, look! Straw Hat is getting away!Dialogue: 5,0:09:57.87,0:09:59.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot!Dialogue: 5,0:09:59.16,0:10:00.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna be surrounded!Dialogue: 5,0:10:01.71,0:10:02.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Nami! – Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:10:06.50,0:10:07.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight!Dialogue: 5,0:10:07.92,0:10:09.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!Dialogue: 5,0:10:09.67,0:10:10.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away!Dialogue: 5,0:10:17.39,0:10:18.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They got away!Dialogue: 5,0:10:18.48,0:10:19.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After them!Dialogue: 5,0:10:24.00,0:10:25.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bro?Dialogue: 5,0:10:25.60,0:10:27.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hmm?Dialogue: 5,0:10:27.10,0:10:30.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They got away.  Shouldn't you go after them?Dialogue: 5,0:10:30.73,0:10:35.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I ran outta fuel when I shot the Coup de Vent.Dialogue: 5,0:10:35.32,0:10:37.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look at my pompadour.Dialogue: 5,0:10:37.92,0:10:41.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it looks like a willow swaying in the wind.Dialogue: 5,0:10:43.05,0:10:45.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those damn bastards got in my way.Dialogue: 5,0:10:45.76,0:10:49.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once I'm done refueling,  I'll eliminate him once and for all.Dialogue: 5,0:10:51.71,0:10:54.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As expected from a 100-million-belly man,Dialogue: 5,0:10:54.13,0:10:56.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he sure has guts.Dialogue: 5,0:11:02.06,0:11:03.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Devil take him!Dialogue: 5,0:11:04.27,0:11:06.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky has really done a number on us.Dialogue: 5,0:11:06.81,0:11:09.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a terrible day today is!Dialogue: 5,0:11:09.27,0:11:12.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At any rate, we can't let them get away.Dialogue: 5,0:11:13.53,0:11:15.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna is coming tonight.Dialogue: 5,0:11:15.82,0:11:18.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Except for the two sea train departures remaining for today,Dialogue: 5,0:11:18.99,0:11:21.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they have no means to leave this island.Dialogue: 5,0:11:21.58,0:11:24.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, they can no longer use  the ship they came on.Dialogue: 5,0:11:25.19,0:11:27.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll gather information.Dialogue: 5,0:11:27.68,0:11:31.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spread all the Galley-La craftsmen   around the island.Dialogue: 5,0:11:31.70,0:11:34.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna settle this before sunset!Dialogue: 5,0:11:46.52,0:11:49.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandma! Grandma! It's Water Seven!Dialogue: 5,0:11:51.70,0:11:55.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get so excited  that you fall into the sea.Dialogue: 5,0:12:07.52,0:12:10.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That must be Galley-La Company's main office.Dialogue: 5,0:12:10.71,0:12:13.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's connected to Dock One.Dialogue: 5,0:12:13.28,0:12:14.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look.Dialogue: 5,0:12:15.17,0:12:18.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looks like there are reportersDialogue: 5,0:12:18.13,0:12:22.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and shipwrights gathered there.Dialogue: 5,0:12:22.61,0:12:25.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san must be in that building.Dialogue: 5,0:12:28.38,0:12:29.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sure about this?Dialogue: 5,0:12:30.27,0:12:31.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course.Dialogue: 5,0:12:31.73,0:12:36.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll go ask Iceboss in person  about why he said Robin was one of the culprits.Dialogue: 5,0:12:36.94,0:12:42.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, the entire island's after us! We can't do anything stupid.Dialogue: 5,0:12:42.57,0:12:46.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make sure you get some idea  where his room is beforehand,Dialogue: 5,0:12:46.46,0:12:48.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and find an opportunity to sneak in.Dialogue: 5,0:12:49.79,0:12:51.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, I'm off.Dialogue: 5,0:12:52.76,0:12:53.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:12:56.64,0:12:57.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 5,0:12:57.38,0:12:58.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They couldn't find them.Dialogue: 5,0:13:05.58,0:13:06.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's that?!Dialogue: 5,0:13:06.89,0:13:08.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah... That's...! Dialogue: 5,0:13:14.69,0:13:16.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The window broke!Dialogue: 5,0:13:16.44,0:13:17.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened?!Dialogue: 5,0:13:18.74,0:13:20.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's an attack!Dialogue: 5,0:13:20.32,0:13:25.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy has broken into the main office!Dialogue: 5,0:13:25.49,0:13:27.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! In the middle of the day?!Dialogue: 5,0:13:27.70,0:13:29.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way! He's already back at the main office?!Dialogue: 5,0:13:30.62,0:13:31.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is he?!Dialogue: 5,0:13:32.17,0:13:34.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's near the stairs to the third floor!Dialogue: 5,0:13:34.13,0:13:35.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where are the foremen?!Dialogue: 5,0:13:35.42,0:13:39.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're out stationing craftsmen around the island! It's just us!Dialogue: 5,0:13:40.02,0:13:43.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's wearing a red vest and a straw hat!Dialogue: 5,0:13:43.21,0:13:46.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Protect Iceburg-san !Dialogue: 5,0:13:47.21,0:13:49.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Straw Hat!Dialogue: 5,0:13:51.89,0:13:53.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?!Dialogue: 5,0:13:54.73,0:13:56.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where is he? Where?Dialogue: 5,0:14:05.41,0:14:08.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Idiot! Don't shoot your pistol in here!Dialogue: 5,0:14:08.14,0:14:10.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not good for Iceburg-san !Dialogue: 5,0:14:13.10,0:14:16.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about the commotion outside.Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.71,0:14:19.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, what's going on?Dialogue: 5,0:14:19.81,0:14:23.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was told that Straw Hat Luffy  has broken into the building.Dialogue: 5,0:14:25.93,0:14:29.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalifa, I have a favor to ask.Dialogue: 5,0:14:32.24,0:14:33.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There he is!Dialogue: 5,0:14:33.15,0:14:34.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!Dialogue: 5,0:14:36.23,0:14:38.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! So many of them!Dialogue: 5,0:14:38.44,0:14:41.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's going to Building Two!  Go around from upstairs!Dialogue: 5,0:14:47.95,0:14:49.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!Dialogue: 5,0:14:53.58,0:14:54.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's her!Dialogue: 5,0:14:56.03,0:14:59.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalifa-san, did a pirate come this way?Dialogue: 5,0:14:59.21,0:15:03.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, he didn't. More importantly,  chase after him more quietly.Dialogue: 5,0:15:03.82,0:15:06.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san is still recovering.Dialogue: 5,0:15:06.37,0:15:07.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.Dialogue: 5,0:15:07.59,0:15:10.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Looks like Straw Hat  hasn't gotten this far yet.Dialogue: 5,0:15:10.57,0:15:11.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's stand watch here.Dialogue: 5,0:15:11.72,0:15:14.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His target is definitely this room!Dialogue: 5,0:15:25.30,0:15:29.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um, you wanted to see me, right, pirate kid?Dialogue: 5,0:15:29.91,0:15:33.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right. Thanks for calling me in. That saved me.Dialogue: 5,0:15:33.69,0:15:38.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I doubt you came all the way here by yourself  to kill me in this commotion.Dialogue: 5,0:15:38.19,0:15:40.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I came to hear the truth!Dialogue: 5,0:15:42.04,0:15:45.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Last night, I saw Nico Robin with my own eyes.Dialogue: 5,0:15:47.55,0:15:51.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And she is one of you.Dialogue: 5,0:15:51.15,0:15:52.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the truth.Dialogue: 5,0:15:52.85,0:15:55.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was it really Robin?!Dialogue: 5,0:15:55.80,0:15:57.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't say a word.Dialogue: 5,0:15:58.61,0:16:01.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your words no longer mean anything.Dialogue: 5,0:16:02.66,0:16:05.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I called you in here...Dialogue: 5,0:16:05.32,0:16:07.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,because I have a favor to ask.Dialogue: 5,0:16:08.49,0:16:12.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me see Nico Robin again now!Dialogue: 5,0:16:14.54,0:16:18.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're here! We're here!  Grandma Kokoro! Hurry! Hurry!Dialogue: 5,0:16:18.58,0:16:20.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get carried away.Dialogue: 5,0:16:24.17,0:16:27.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Water Seven. It's been a while.Dialogue: 5,0:16:27.72,0:16:30.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grandma! Hurry! Hurry!Dialogue: 5,0:16:30.09,0:16:31.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.Dialogue: 5,0:16:32.14,0:16:36.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Today, wearing a mask is prohibited while boarding the sea train.Dialogue: 5,0:16:36.98,0:16:39.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please show me your ticket and your face.Dialogue: 5,0:16:39.14,0:16:41.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is my face!Dialogue: 5,0:16:42.40,0:16:43.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:16:43.90,0:16:45.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you.Dialogue: 5,0:16:45.19,0:16:48.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! Kokoro-san ! Hello!Dialogue: 5,0:16:48.20,0:16:50.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's all the fuss about?Dialogue: 5,0:16:50.74,0:16:56.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Oh, we're hunting the Straw Hats. Seems they're  responsible for Iceburg-san's attempted assassination.Dialogue: 5,0:16:56.16,0:16:59.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg? Assassination? Hm?Dialogue: 5,0:16:59.96,0:17:02.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Ah...Dialogue: 5,0:17:02.79,0:17:04.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,These people?Dialogue: 5,0:17:07.67,0:17:12.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll say it again. Let me see Nico Robin.Dialogue: 5,0:17:13.89,0:17:16.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.Dialogue: 5,0:17:16.77,0:17:18.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't know where she is.Dialogue: 5,0:17:26.36,0:17:27.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gunfire!Dialogue: 5,0:17:27.94,0:17:29.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It came from the bedroom!Dialogue: 5,0:17:34.07,0:17:36.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg-san !Dialogue: 5,0:17:42.58,0:17:45.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-You're okay...Dialogue: 5,0:17:45.63,0:17:47.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 5,0:17:47.80,0:17:51.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet on a silly hope that I might get closer to the truth.Dialogue: 5,0:17:52.42,0:17:55.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Capture all the Straw Hats!Dialogue: 5,0:17:56.10,0:17:57.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course!Dialogue: 5,0:18:01.52,0:18:02.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey Luffy,Dialogue: 5,0:18:02.89,0:18:06.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,did you get a chance to talk to Iceburg-san ?Dialogue: 5,0:18:06.48,0:18:09.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah. He said he really saw Robin.Dialogue: 5,0:18:09.65,0:18:13.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't be! Why would Robin  do something like that?Dialogue: 5,0:18:13.24,0:18:14.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I refuse to believe it!Dialogue: 5,0:18:36.22,0:18:37.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome.Dialogue: 5,0:18:37.80,0:18:40.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's it going, Blueno?!Dialogue: 5,0:18:40.89,0:18:44.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it going super?!Dialogue: 5,0:18:46.86,0:18:48.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think we're doing good.Dialogue: 5,0:18:48.61,0:18:52.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "I think"?!  You're such an indecisive guy!Dialogue: 5,0:18:52.69,0:18:55.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me the usual! Fill 'em up!Dialogue: 5,0:18:56.16,0:18:58.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got money?Dialogue: 5,0:18:58.12,0:19:00.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just refill them! Cola!Dialogue: 5,0:19:00.79,0:19:03.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why would you run your bar so greedilyDialogue: 5,0:19:03.37,0:19:06.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as to take money from your customers?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:06.29,0:19:07.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got money.Dialogue: 5,0:19:07.92,0:19:10.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have a million belly left over.Dialogue: 5,0:19:10.34,0:19:11.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:11.55,0:19:14.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've got that much money left from yesterday?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:14.01,0:19:16.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How shameful! How uncool!Dialogue: 5,0:19:16.47,0:19:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I didn't spend it all yesterday!Dialogue: 5,0:19:19.39,0:19:20.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give it here!Dialogue: 5,0:19:21.52,0:19:24.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys are lucky!Dialogue: 5,0:19:24.64,0:19:28.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All your drinks are on me!Dialogue: 5,0:19:28.31,0:19:31.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drink to your hearts' content!Dialogue: 5,0:19:31.15,0:19:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! That's our Franky! So generous!Dialogue: 5,0:19:35.20,0:19:39.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the man! The face of the Water Seven underworld! Thanks!Dialogue: 5,0:19:39.37,0:19:41.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Awesome!Dialogue: 5,0:19:41.58,0:19:43.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's more over there!Dialogue: 5,0:19:43.29,0:19:45.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Blueno! Where's my cola?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:45.54,0:19:47.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, already!Dialogue: 5,0:19:47.83,0:19:50.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like you're doing well for yourself, Franky.Dialogue: 5,0:19:50.79,0:19:52.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 5,0:19:53.59,0:19:56.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kokoro, you old hag! That was you?!Dialogue: 5,0:19:57.05,0:20:00.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought you were some sorta' monster statue!Dialogue: 5,0:20:02.76,0:20:06.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, is it okay to get a refill for my juice, Franky?!Dialogue: 5,0:20:06.52,0:20:10.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is a bar. It's no place for kids!Dialogue: 5,0:20:10.40,0:20:12.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're doing well, aren't ya?Dialogue: 5,0:20:12.07,0:20:15.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Okay, then. Suit yourself.Dialogue: 5,0:20:15.32,0:20:17.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right! Juice!Dialogue: 5,0:20:17.82,0:20:21.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'm doing well,  but I'm in a bad mood. I feel terrible.Dialogue: 5,0:20:21.95,0:20:26.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling terrible this week,  thanks to that damn pirate!Dialogue: 5,0:20:26.50,0:20:28.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All filled up! Thanks for waiting!Dialogue: 5,0:20:28.33,0:20:29.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, took you long enough!Dialogue: 5,0:20:29.92,0:20:33.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fuel! Fuel!Dialogue: 5,0:20:36.34,0:20:40.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here it comes. Here it comes.  Here it comes!Dialogue: 5,0:20:46.52,0:20:49.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Super!Dialogue: 5,0:20:50.60,0:20:55.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm re-energized!  Next time I see that jerk, he's done for!Dialogue: 5,0:20:55.57,0:20:57.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the way, old hag, why are you here?Dialogue: 5,0:20:57.78,0:21:00.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqua Laguna is coming.Dialogue: 5,0:21:00.41,0:21:05.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? Is that right?  No wonder the wind is strong.Dialogue: 5,0:21:05.04,0:21:07.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you done getting your house ready?Dialogue: 5,0:21:07.91,0:21:10.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, my house is gone.Dialogue: 5,0:21:10.50,0:21:13.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing that could sink,  so I have no worries.Dialogue: 5,0:21:19.13,0:21:23.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was going to have a drink with Iceburg,  but I heard he got shot.Dialogue: 5,0:21:23.55,0:21:25.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what I heard too.Dialogue: 5,0:21:25.47,0:21:27.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're saying those pirates did it.Dialogue: 5,0:21:27.18,0:21:29.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Galley-La and the townsfolk  are livid right now.Dialogue: 5,0:21:29.89,0:21:33.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirates did it?Dialogue: 5,0:21:33.48,0:21:36.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you seriously think that's the case?Dialogue: 5,0:21:36.32,0:21:38.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sound like you know something.Dialogue: 5,0:21:38.24,0:21:40.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't say whatever pops into your head, old hag.Dialogue: 5,0:21:40.57,0:21:45.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The World Government has been  nagging Iceburg for a long time.Dialogue: 5,0:21:45.28,0:21:50.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Then, what? Are you saying that official, Corgi, did it?Dialogue: 5,0:21:50.62,0:21:53.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That tubby blob ain't the assassin type!Dialogue: 5,0:21:53.63,0:21:58.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, covert ops are the work of CP9.Dialogue: 5,0:21:58.71,0:22:00.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you know about it, Blueno?Dialogue: 5,0:22:01.17,0:22:02.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just heard some rumors.Dialogue: 5,0:22:02.63,0:22:08.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cripes. The sheeple sure do swallow up  every crazy tale about secret organizations.Dialogue: 5,0:22:08.97,0:22:11.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How foolish. It does exist.Dialogue: 5,0:22:11.27,0:22:17.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But they never show themselves,  since they're a secretive black-ops unit.Dialogue: 5,0:22:23.20,0:22:26.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's that confidence coming from?  Do you know something?Dialogue: 5,0:22:28.03,0:22:31.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard about it from some guy.Dialogue: 5,0:22:31.08,0:22:34.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's just a rumor, then!  Don't mess with–Dialogue: 5,0:22:34.92,0:22:38.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The scary thing is that it's always a rumor.Dialogue: 5,0:22:39.13,0:22:42.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They eliminate people without anyone noticing.Dialogue: 5,0:22:42.51,0:22:45.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you meddle with them, you're dead meat.Dialogue: 5,0:22:52.48,0:22:57.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks. The job we had to do yesterday went well.Dialogue: 5,0:22:57.11,0:22:59.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well done, Nico Robin.Dialogue: 5,0:23:03.82,0:23:05.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was a piece of cake.Dialogue: 5,0:23:05.53,0:23:10.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Naturally. Although, now you're being pursued by the whole town.Dialogue: 5,0:23:10.49,0:23:12.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 5,0:23:12.25,0:23:15.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that's just temporary.Dialogue: 5,0:23:15.00,0:23:18.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's important is... tonight.Dialogue: 5,0:23:19.54,0:23:22.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll infiltrate Iceburg's residence one more time.Dialogue: 5,0:23:22.26,0:23:27.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If worse comes to worst,  I don't mind eliminating all the evidence.Dialogue: 5,0:23:28.05,0:23:31.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tom had it originally, and of his disciples,Dialogue: 5,0:23:31.64,0:23:35.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iceburg is the only one alive today.Dialogue: 5,0:23:35.44,0:23:38.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter how much he plays innocent,Dialogue: 5,0:23:38.27,0:23:42.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,in the name of CP9,  we'll be sure to take it from him tonight.Dialogue: 5,0:23:43.03,0:23:47.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bear in mind that this is a mission for justice.Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.17,0:01:56.35,Title,,0,0,0,,RumorsDialogue: 1,0:01:50.17,0:01:56.35,Title,,0,0,0,,RumorsDialogue: 0,0:16:12.41,0:16:18.25,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Blue StationDialogue: 1,0:16:12.41,0:16:18.25,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Blue StationDialogue: 0,0:18:16.37,0:18:18.70,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Main Street Water SevenDialogue: 1,0:18:16.37,0:18:18.70,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Main Street Water SevenDialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:31.80,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:26.24,0:00:31.80,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 2,0:00:26.24,0:00:31.80,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:31.80,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.24,0:00:31.80,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.51,0:00:36.96,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 1,0:00:32.51,0:00:36.96,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,GraphicsDialogue: 2,0:00:32.51,0:00:36.96,Credits-207+,,0